<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Reading a CSV written by another program.

  Laid out like the settings screens: a heading, a line of small type saying
  what the section is for, then the controls. It used to be labels and bare
  spinners at 3dp of padding, separated by hairlines, with the three number
  settings squeezed into a table.

